works/\">Ramblings about JavaScript scope, weird errors and frameworks</a> (Salma Alam-Naylor)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/webcare-webshare/\">webcare-webshare Web Component</a> (Zach Leatherman)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/updates/public-preview-configascode-customizations-in-microsoft-dev-box/\">Public preview: Configuration-as-code customizations in Microsoft Dev Box</a> (Azure Team)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.i-programmer.info/news/80-java/16987-dart-adds-webassembly-support.html\">Dart Adds WebAssembly Support</a> (Kay Ewbank)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://textslashplain.com/2024/02/20/cloaking-detonation-and-client-side-phishing-detection/\">Cloaking, Detonation, and Client-side Phishing Detection</a> (Eric Lawrence)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.postman.com/what-is-api-mocking/\">What is API mocking?</a> (Allen Helton)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>WinUI, .NET MAUI &amp; XAML</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.syncfusion.com/blogs/post/wpf-bar-chart-us-students.aspx?utm_source=alvinashcraft&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=alvinashcraft_blog_edmfeb24\">Chart of the Week: Creating a WPF Bar Chart to Visualize the Homelands of America’s International Students</a> (Saiyathalifathimabee Moidhinabdhulkathar)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Visual Studio &amp; .NET</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://khalidabuhakmeh.com/how-to-map-sql-results-to-any-object-using-entity-framework-core-8\">How to Map SQL Results To Any Object Using Entity Framework Core 8</a> (Khalid Abuhakmeh)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://code-maze.com/csharp-get-the-number-of-lines-in-a-text-file/\">How to Get the Number of Lines in a Text File in C#</a> (Karthikeyan N S)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hackernoon.com/a-detailed-guide-to-string-concatenation-in-net?source=rss\">A Detailed Guide to String Concatenation in .NET</a> (Aleksei)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Design, Methodology, AI &amp; Testing</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.everyda