ts of Bad Code in Software Development</a> (Liz Ryan)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tech.slashdot.org/story/24/02/20/1441252/adobe-acrobat-adds-generative-ai-to-easily-chat-with-documents?utm_source=rss1.0mainlinkanon&amp;utm_medium=feed\">Adobe Acrobat Adds Generative AI To ‘Easily Chat With Documents’</a> (msmash)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/oldnewthing/20240220-00/?p=109428\">Microspeak: Closing out, duping out</a> (Raymond Chen)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thenewstack.io/figma-caters-to-developers-with-dev-mode-and-ai-integrations/\">Figma Caters to Developers with Dev Mode and AI Integrations</a> (Richard MacManus)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://seankilleen.com/2024/02/how-to-set-up-netlify-deploys-for-docfx-using-github-actions/\">How to Set up Netlify Deploys for Docfx using GitHub Actions</a> (Sean Killeen)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://idratherbewriting.com/blog/task-decomposition-prompt-engineering-series\">Prompt engineering: Task decomposition and complex tree diagrams</a> (Tom Johnson)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Mobile, IoT &amp; Game Development</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://firebase.blog/posts/2024/02/app-check-comes-to-google-idp-ios\">App Check comes to Google Identity for iOS!</a> (Victor Fan &amp; Charlotte Liang)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://swift.org/blog/mlx-swift/\">On-device ML research with MLX and Swift</a> (Swift Team)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ionic.io/blog/catching-up-with-the-latest-features-in-angular\">Catching Up With The Latest Features In Angular</a> (Mike Hartington)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.imaginativeuniversal.com/blog/2024/02/20/video-capture-experiences-in-apple-vision-pro/\">Video capture tips for the Apple Vision Pro</a> (James Ashley)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Screencasts &amp; Videos</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTUemhV9W-M\">Advanced scenario with FluentUI-Blazor | Open at Microsoft</a> (Pablo Lopes &amp; Denis Voituron)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sHDox4Fx6G0\">What is ASP.NET Core? | Web Development with .NET for Beginners</a> (Safia Abdalla &amp; Daniel Roth)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOJRzVqTmBY\">Generate PDF Files in Your .NET MAUI App or ANY .NET Application!</a> (Gerald Versluis)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nDojpekD8yo\">FreeCodeSession – Episode 521</a> (Jason Bock)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YEplterQDw4\">Coffee and Open Source Conversation – Stephanie Stimac</a> (Isaac Levin)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G38z1iaqPlM\">Advent of Code 2023 Day 22: Sand Slabs ✅✅</a> (Martin Zikmund)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RkV0aJdrkBg\">Mr. Maeda’s Cozy AI Kitchen – Inclusive Healthcare with AI, with Wendy Johansson</a> (John Maeda)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Podcasts</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://scrummastertoolbox.libsyn.com/disjoint-silos-the-illusion-of-teamwork-and-how-it-affects-agile-coaches-work-johannes-andersen\">Scrum Master Toolbox Podcast – Disjoint Silos, The Illusion of Teamwork and How it Affects Agile Coaches’ Work | Johannes Andersen</a> (Vasco Duarte)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://sites.libsyn.com/419861/api-machinery-chaos-and-washing-machines-with-lucas-kldstrm\">Kubernetes Podcast from Google – API Machinery, Chaos and Dishwashers, with Lucas Käldström</a> (Abdel Sghiouar &amp; Kaslin Fields)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://runasradio.com/Shows/Show/920\">RunAs Radio – Windows Server vNext with Jeff Woolsey</a> (Richard Campbell)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://share.transistor.fm/s/d11fef52\">The 20 Mile March | Multithreaded Income Episode 30 with Brian Gorman</a> (Kevin Griffin)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pythonbytes.fm/episodes/show/372/uv-an-impressive-pip-alternative\">Python Bytes Podcast #372 – uv – an impressive pip alternative</a> (Michael Kennedy)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://theamphour.com/659-altium-acquired/\">The Amp Hour #659 – Altium…Acquired!</a> (Dave Jones &amp; Chris Gammell)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Community &amp; Events</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://christianheilmann.com/2024/02/21/how-does-a-changed-market-affect-developer-relations/\">How does a changed market affect Developer Relations?</a> (Chris Heilmann)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dotnettips.wordpress.com/2024/02/20/rockin-the-code-world-season-4-panel-show-the-important-of-attending-in-person-conferences/\">Rockin’ the Code World Season 4 Panel Show: The Importance of Attending In-Person Conferences</a> (David McCarter)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://news.xbox.com/en-us/2024/02/20/happy-10th-anniversary-xbox-insider-program/\">Happy 10th Anniversary: Xbox Insider Program</a> (Ian)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>Database</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.mssqltips.com/sqlservertip/7921/ssrs-2022-install-setup-and-configuration/\">SSRS 2022 Install, Setup and Configuration</a> (Joe Gavin)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/azure-data-explorer-blog/update-records-in-a-kusto-database-public-preview/ba-p/4059695\">Update records in a Kusto Database (Public Preview)</a> (Vincent-Philippe Lauzon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://erikdarling.com/indexing-sql-server-queries-for-performance-fixing-windowing-functions/\">Indexing SQL Server Queries For Performance: Fixing Windowing Functions</a> (Erik Darling)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/cosmosdb/azure-cosmos-db-design-patterns-part-7-materialized-views/\">Azure Cosmos DB design patterns – Part 7: Materialized View</a> (Jay Gordon)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>SharePoint, M365 &amp; MS Teams</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"http://www.sharepointnutsandbolts.com/2024/02/Microsoft-365-Copilot-plugins.html\">Getting started with plugin development for Copilot for Microsoft 365</a> (Chris O’Brien)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>More Link Collections</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blog.cwa.me.uk/2024/02/21/the-morning-brew-3886/\">The Morning Brew #3886</a> (Chris Alcock)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://seroter.com/2024/02/20/daily-reading-list-february-20th-2024-262/\">Daily Reading List – February 20th, 2024 (#262)</a> (Richard Seroter)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>The Geek Shelf</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/1805120069/?tag=amavin-20\"><img align=\"left\" style=\"margin:0px 4px 0px 0px;border:0px;float:left;background-image:none;\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iZfOsb2yL._SS135_.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"51iZfOsb2yL._SS135_.jpg\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/1805120069/?tag=amavin-20\">Learn WinUI 3: Leverage WinUI and the Windows App SDK to create modern Windows applications with C# and XAML</a> (Alvin Ashcraft)<em> – Referral Link</em></p>",
